        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Ordered food on Uber, bag was not secured, anyone could have access to the food inside. Paper bags were left open too.",
        "time": 1767559386,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "hritik harani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112375081515419653373/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqQXhZz0h4_XWdIY5FQcxjLBB9dJ3tGsIsZEJLzwwv6XrykA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The staff is really rude and zero customer service. I think we are giving food for free; the way they behave and talk to customers. I should have checked the reviews before going there, now I see many people have complained about it already.",
        "time": 1758327364,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "anu Thiyagarajah",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100340424780554786139/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ-uyHTyf4TOTYXaKMnzHj2SGnQpTnvE90uiCz6Up-31GGkg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Ordered garlic naan what a ripoff. They put garlic and butter on a pre packaged naan and sell it for 3$ each. Super small not even looks like naan. The funny thing is I already ate that plain naan before. Will never go back again. Very disappointed",
        "time": 1745720509,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jophin Joseph",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100696182836404539022/reviews",
        "language": "en",
